WEBVTT

00:00:25.890 --> 00:00:26.900
Toko-chan?

00:00:27.920 --> 00:00:32.070
That train would take us to
Yuki-chan, wouldn't it?

00:00:38.240 --> 00:00:41.620
Only I know your pain...

00:00:42.460 --> 00:00:44.130
Your uncertainty...

00:00:44.860 --> 00:00:46.900
Your loneliness...

00:00:48.240 --> 00:00:52.150
If only we could be together forever.

00:00:53.880 --> 00:00:58.600
I'll say it as many times as you wish.

00:01:06.830 --> 00:01:08.860
I will not betray you!

00:02:56.530 --> 00:02:58.260
You haven't slept, Yuki.

00:02:58.260 --> 00:02:59.630
Aren't you tired?

00:03:01.230 --> 00:03:02.130
Sodom.

00:03:03.520 --> 00:03:07.630
Takashiro-san gave me a lot of information,

00:03:08.480 --> 00:03:11.110
but there was one thing I couldn't ask him.

00:03:12.950 --> 00:03:14.270
I couldn't ask him about Luka.

00:03:15.310 --> 00:03:16.270
Master?

00:03:17.470 --> 00:03:22.990
I've been wondering what happened between
Luka and me in the previous life.

00:03:33.110 --> 00:03:36.790
Yuki, let's go look for master!

00:03:57.730 --> 00:04:01.110
Were you able to get some rest last night?

00:04:05.190 --> 00:04:09.200
Thank you. I was just a little thirsty.

00:04:13.730 --> 00:04:15.990
I heard he's decided to fight.

00:04:17.020 --> 00:04:17.910
Yes.

00:04:19.770 --> 00:04:23.560
I'll have Yuki stay here for a while.

00:04:24.230 --> 00:04:26.050
It's almost time.

00:04:27.610 --> 00:04:28.410
Yes.

00:04:28.970 --> 00:04:31.050
Takashiro-san, it's Yuki.

00:04:31.510 --> 00:04:32.300
Come in.

00:04:32.800 --> 00:04:33.920
Excuse me.

00:04:36.260 --> 00:04:38.100
Did you need something, Yuki?

00:04:38.640 --> 00:04:42.650
Well, I wondered if I could leave
the mansion for a little bit.

00:04:44.430 --> 00:04:45.900
I want to see Luka.

00:04:46.660 --> 00:04:48.320
Do you know where he is?

00:04:48.320 --> 00:04:51.400
I'm sure he's nearby.

00:04:52.550 --> 00:04:55.620
I'll have Senshiro and Kuroto
accompany you.

00:04:56.840 --> 00:04:58.370
Thank you.

00:04:59.240 --> 00:05:00.060
See you.

00:05:00.260 --> 00:05:00.970
Yuki.

00:05:00.970 --> 00:05:02.000
Yes?

00:05:02.810 --> 00:05:07.500
Knowing everything can cloud your mind.

00:05:10.470 --> 00:05:15.470
A World Without You

00:05:28.850 --> 00:05:30.220
We're here.

00:05:32.220 --> 00:05:34.000
Yeah. Are you cold, Toko-chan?

00:05:34.000 --> 00:05:35.210
I'm fine.

00:05:39.050 --> 00:05:43.330
Yuki-chan and them are on the other
side of those mountains.

00:05:44.200 --> 00:05:46.020
I wonder what Luka is up to.

00:05:46.020 --> 00:05:49.360
I can't imagine he's entered the mansion.

00:05:49.360 --> 00:05:54.760
I guess there are still members of the
family who don't trust Luka.

00:05:56.250 --> 00:05:58.260
Unfortunately, yes.

00:05:59.300 --> 00:06:01.780
Tsukumo, do you remember...

00:06:02.730 --> 00:06:05.990
How Luka was, before Yuki-chan
came to the Twilight Mansion?

00:06:05.990 --> 00:06:07.020
Yeah.

00:06:07.020 --> 00:06:09.670
No one could break through his wall.

00:06:10.450 --> 00:06:13.880
When I realized there was
nothing I could do,

00:06:13.880 --> 00:06:16.320
I was so hurt and so sad.

00:06:17.110 --> 00:06:22.200
But since Yuki-chan came, he's finally
started to acknowledge us, too.

00:06:23.700 --> 00:06:24.790
You're right.

00:06:25.400 --> 00:06:28.890
They're both our precious friends.

00:06:28.890 --> 00:06:29.960
Yeah.

00:06:31.580 --> 00:06:33.990
Can you hear their voices?

00:06:33.990 --> 00:06:35.650
Not right now.

00:06:36.270 --> 00:06:37.340
I see.

00:06:55.400 --> 00:06:56.270
Luka.

00:07:01.720 --> 00:07:03.880
We were just here.

00:07:05.940 --> 00:07:07.890
Do you have any idea where to search?

00:07:07.890 --> 00:07:09.460
No...

00:07:09.460 --> 00:07:10.610
I knew it.

00:07:10.610 --> 00:07:11.480
Kuroto...

00:07:11.940 --> 00:07:16.000
I'm sorry. I don't think he'd have gone far.

00:07:16.910 --> 00:07:19.400
I'm sure he's around here.

00:07:20.330 --> 00:07:22.250
You must really trust each other.

00:07:23.630 --> 00:07:26.000
You're always thinking of each other,

00:07:26.000 --> 00:07:27.570
never doubting one another.

00:07:28.310 --> 00:07:30.380
Even if you've been reincarnated,

00:07:30.380 --> 00:07:31.900
you're destined to meet again.

00:07:33.150 --> 00:07:35.400
I'm a little jealous of Luka.

00:07:35.400 --> 00:07:40.890
Did something happen
with the three of you?

00:07:41.580 --> 00:07:42.580
Why do you ask?

00:07:42.580 --> 00:07:45.600
I just thought something might have.

00:07:46.440 --> 00:07:48.100
We owe him.

00:07:48.100 --> 00:07:49.120
Owe him?

00:07:50.380 --> 00:07:52.080
We owe him an enormous favor.

00:07:57.000 --> 00:08:02.680
Just like you, everyone involved
in this war carries a burden.

00:08:05.360 --> 00:08:06.830
I guess that's how you'd say it.

00:08:09.610 --> 00:08:11.200
A burden...

00:08:24.310 --> 00:08:25.910
<i>Never forget.</i>

00:08:26.830 --> 00:08:31.430
<i>No matter what happens,
no matter how many times I am reborn,</i>

00:08:32.480 --> 00:08:35.290
<i>I will always love you.</i>

00:08:47.460 --> 00:08:50.910
Impossible. She can't be alive.

00:09:05.270 --> 00:09:06.430
Shall we go back?

00:09:07.740 --> 00:09:09.230
The sun will set soon.

00:09:10.130 --> 00:09:11.390
Just a little longer...

00:09:12.320 --> 00:09:15.000
Let me search a little longer.

00:09:15.560 --> 00:09:18.880
I can't stand the thought of Luka
having to be alone.

00:09:18.880 --> 00:09:20.470
I'm sorry!

00:09:20.470 --> 00:09:22.350
He must be important to you.

00:09:23.940 --> 00:09:25.320
Luka.

00:09:27.810 --> 00:09:32.200
Our job is to protect you.

00:09:32.200 --> 00:09:35.520
I'm sorry! Thank you.

00:09:35.520 --> 00:09:37.160
I'm so sorry!

00:09:37.160 --> 00:09:37.980
Just let it go.

00:09:39.030 --> 00:09:40.490
Sorry about that, Yuki-kun.

00:09:40.490 --> 00:09:43.910
Deep down, Kuroto's a nice guy,
despite his actions.

00:09:44.430 --> 00:09:45.600
Senshiro!

00:09:46.750 --> 00:09:48.180
You embarrass so easily, Kuroto.

00:09:48.180 --> 00:09:50.250
Shut up! Shut up!

00:09:50.250 --> 00:09:52.110
That's what makes you so cute.

00:09:53.590 --> 00:09:56.250
Luka, where are you?

00:10:22.910 --> 00:10:29.760
Tsukumo, I wonder how Yuki-chan feels,
now that he's talked to Takashiro-sama.

00:10:29.760 --> 00:10:30.910
Yeah.

00:10:32.320 --> 00:10:35.560
From here on, our confrontations
with the Duras will only increase.

00:10:35.560 --> 00:10:37.690
When I think about Yuki-chan
carrying that pain

00:10:37.690 --> 00:10:41.050
every time someone gets hurt, I...

00:10:41.890 --> 00:10:43.110
It's not easy.

00:10:45.570 --> 00:10:48.790
Let's protect Yuki, no matter what happens.

00:10:49.760 --> 00:10:50.510
Yeah.

00:10:51.100 --> 00:10:52.810
Shall I see what I can hear?

00:10:53.550 --> 00:10:56.150
I just don't want anything
to happen to Yuki-chan.

00:10:57.170 --> 00:10:59.230
I'll listen to the waves for now.

00:11:05.960 --> 00:11:09.070
Come out. I know you're there.

00:11:16.940 --> 00:11:20.330
I've missed you, my dear Zess.

00:11:21.800 --> 00:11:23.710
So it's you, Elegy.

00:11:43.670 --> 00:11:47.940
I'm delighted you found me.

00:11:47.940 --> 00:11:52.120
Now come to these open arms!

00:11:53.440 --> 00:11:54.290
Don't be ridiculous.

00:11:55.840 --> 00:12:00.580
Don't look so angry, Zess.

00:12:01.420 --> 00:12:06.380
I've simply come to invite you to join us.

00:12:16.200 --> 00:12:20.110
Fuyutoki, will you tell Yuki to come back?

00:12:20.960 --> 00:12:21.810
Yes.

00:12:22.810 --> 00:12:23.950
This place...

00:12:25.690 --> 00:12:28.130
It's an old Kamakura period battlefield.

00:12:28.130 --> 00:12:32.140
It's one of the places the Giou Clan fought.

00:12:38.120 --> 00:12:40.430
Yuki-kun! What's wrong?

00:12:40.430 --> 00:12:41.880
I'm sorry.

00:12:42.350 --> 00:12:44.590
I suddenly felt dizzy.

00:12:45.030 --> 00:12:46.140
Are you all right?

00:12:46.690 --> 00:12:47.300
Yes.

00:12:47.740 --> 00:12:48.210
Kuroto!

00:12:58.500 --> 00:13:01.100
There's dark power here.

00:13:01.730 --> 00:13:04.400
You were experiencing its effects.

00:13:04.400 --> 00:13:08.700
Someone unbelievably powerful
was just here.

00:13:09.550 --> 00:13:11.710
Could it have been a General Class?

00:13:11.710 --> 00:13:13.530
General Class?

00:13:15.000 --> 00:13:16.510
They're Opasts,

00:13:16.510 --> 00:13:19.160
second in power only to the Aristocracy.
And to the Demon King himself.

00:13:19.160 --> 00:13:23.650
Yuki-kun, let's go back.
We need to get you out of harm's way.

00:13:25.210 --> 00:13:26.040
Luka...

00:13:27.460 --> 00:13:30.720
I really missed you, Zess.

00:13:33.220 --> 00:13:36.970
How long has it been since the last battle?

00:13:39.220 --> 00:13:44.090
I loved your eyes, like gray jewels,

00:13:45.360 --> 00:13:47.650
and your jet-black hair.

00:13:48.640 --> 00:13:51.160
But you suddenly betrayed us.

00:13:51.710 --> 00:13:53.780
It came as such a shock.

00:13:54.680 --> 00:13:59.200
Zess, won't you return to us?

00:14:00.260 --> 00:14:01.080
Won't you?

00:14:07.800 --> 00:14:09.880
Is that all you wanted to say?

00:14:14.360 --> 00:14:16.650
You really are a fool!

00:14:16.650 --> 00:14:19.870
You were stupid to have been taken
in by that disgusting human girl.

00:14:19.870 --> 00:14:22.520
I can't believe you betrayed us like that!

00:14:24.140 --> 00:14:28.060
Unfortunately, I never considered
myself one of you.

00:14:28.940 --> 00:14:30.450
My past and my future...

00:14:30.450 --> 00:14:32.400
Everything belongs to Yuki.

00:14:34.000 --> 00:14:35.120
Draw your weapon.

00:14:37.300 --> 00:14:38.490
Let's get this over with.

00:14:41.360 --> 00:14:42.580
What a shame!

00:14:49.960 --> 00:14:50.890
Luka...

00:14:55.420 --> 00:14:58.030
Fuyutoki, has Yuki returned?

00:14:58.030 --> 00:15:00.470
Not yet. I'll go after him myself.

00:15:00.470 --> 00:15:01.640
Please do.

00:15:01.640 --> 00:15:02.460
Yes.

00:15:11.640 --> 00:15:13.190
You dog!

00:15:15.360 --> 00:15:18.870
Dog! Dog! Dog! Dog!

00:15:18.870 --> 00:15:23.920
You're nothing more than a dog!

00:15:34.970 --> 00:15:36.420
Is that all?

00:15:38.850 --> 00:15:41.300
You'll die if you don't try harder.

00:15:42.720 --> 00:15:45.560
Still the proud dog you always were.

00:15:47.080 --> 00:15:50.300
Forget that human.

00:15:51.290 --> 00:15:57.100
I heard that since her rebirth,
that girl forgot all about you.

00:15:58.130 --> 00:16:02.370
She never loved you.

00:16:02.370 --> 00:16:06.960
Eternity is an illusion. Love is a game.

00:16:06.960 --> 00:16:10.540
Forget the maggot who seduced you.

00:16:12.180 --> 00:16:15.040
I will never betray you.

00:16:15.730 --> 00:16:17.010
Your efforts are futile.

00:16:17.720 --> 00:16:22.440
It doesn't matter what you say.
I belong to Yuki.

00:16:22.440 --> 00:16:25.980
If she asks me to stay by her side,
I'll never leave her.

00:16:25.980 --> 00:16:27.810
If she asks me to die, I'll die.

00:16:29.810 --> 00:16:31.770
I will not betray Yuki.

00:16:36.780 --> 00:16:38.500
Unbelievable!

00:16:38.500 --> 00:16:40.400
You don't like people.

00:16:40.400 --> 00:16:41.740
You don't love.

00:16:41.740 --> 00:16:44.280
What could such a lofty
creature know of love?

00:16:45.850 --> 00:16:47.390
This is impossible.

00:16:47.390 --> 00:16:50.670
I refuse to acknowledge this!

00:16:50.670 --> 00:16:54.880
I love you so much, but you
and that human girl...

00:16:55.770 --> 00:16:57.300
I'll never forgive you, Zess!

00:16:58.600 --> 00:16:59.590
<i>Skull Deus!</i>

00:17:02.990 --> 00:17:07.200
Let's enjoy our romantic night together.

00:17:17.040 --> 00:17:18.760
What's wrong, Tsukumo?

00:17:18.760 --> 00:17:20.200
Luka is fighting.

00:17:23.540 --> 00:17:25.030
Foul servant of darkness,

00:17:25.750 --> 00:17:29.120
rue the day you rebelled against
your king's blood and die!

00:17:33.460 --> 00:17:34.380
Over there!

00:17:38.280 --> 00:17:40.560
You destroyed my Skull-chan in an instant.

00:17:44.740 --> 00:17:46.550
I told you to try harder.

00:17:55.620 --> 00:17:58.440
It's been a while since I actually bled.

00:17:59.490 --> 00:18:04.210
You're as strong, merciless,
and beautiful as ever, Zess.

00:18:04.210 --> 00:18:10.950
Your blood's purity derives from generations
of intermarriage solely within the family.

00:18:10.950 --> 00:18:16.440
You have tremendous power, and your
beauty surpasses all other infernus.

00:18:16.900 --> 00:18:18.650
You're a thoroughbred.

00:18:20.320 --> 00:18:23.930
Shackled like a criminal and a beast,
from the time you were born.

00:18:25.180 --> 00:18:32.100
More beautifully foul, gloriously vile,
than any other.

00:18:33.360 --> 00:18:34.930
I love you, Zess.

00:18:35.680 --> 00:18:37.060
Are you done?

00:18:38.770 --> 00:18:41.940
I don't have time for you.

00:18:46.930 --> 00:18:48.280
Th-There!

00:18:50.810 --> 00:18:52.790
This ends now, Elegy.

00:18:55.110 --> 00:18:56.900
You think you can kill me?

00:19:04.200 --> 00:19:05.300
Impossible!

00:19:07.370 --> 00:19:08.300
Luka...

00:19:13.990 --> 00:19:16.480
Will you betray me again?

00:19:19.050 --> 00:19:21.850
I love you, Luka.

00:19:29.230 --> 00:19:30.240
Yuki.

00:19:31.940 --> 00:19:32.970
Luka.

00:19:37.680 --> 00:19:39.330
Yuki-chan...

00:19:39.330 --> 00:19:39.350
No...
Yuki-chan...

00:19:39.350 --> 00:19:40.400
No...

00:19:41.730 --> 00:19:42.580
Tsukumo?

00:19:44.110 --> 00:19:44.910
Yuki.

00:19:46.970 --> 00:19:47.890
Luka.

00:20:06.440 --> 00:20:07.470
Luka...

00:20:13.550 --> 00:20:14.620
Yuki...

00:20:15.780 --> 00:20:18.620
I love you...

00:20:26.890 --> 00:20:27.790
Yuki...

00:20:27.790 --> 00:20:28.650
Luka!

00:20:30.430 --> 00:20:31.770
Keep it together!

00:20:31.770 --> 00:20:33.010
Don't be fooled!

00:20:33.300 --> 00:20:37.880
What rude children, interrupting
our conversation.

00:20:41.010 --> 00:20:42.900
You're not cute at all.

00:20:44.080 --> 00:20:45.230
Fine, then.

00:20:47.530 --> 00:20:53.660
I'll leave quietly today.
But next time...

00:21:00.850 --> 00:21:02.210
Are you okay?

00:21:02.210 --> 00:21:05.420
I never expected to be saved by you.

00:21:05.420 --> 00:21:07.530
What do you mean?
Of course we saved you!

00:21:07.530 --> 00:21:09.950
We're on your side.

00:21:09.950 --> 00:21:10.930
My side...

00:21:27.170 --> 00:21:28.420
Fuyutoki-san.

00:21:28.420 --> 00:21:32.000
Perfect timing. I was just
on my way to find you.

00:21:32.000 --> 00:21:35.180
We just detected Duras signs.

00:21:35.620 --> 00:21:36.530
A Duras?

00:21:36.530 --> 00:21:40.970
Yes. Not only that, but it may
have been a General Class.

00:21:41.810 --> 00:21:46.790
I see. I will personally notify
Takashiro-sama of the situation.

00:21:46.790 --> 00:21:48.830
Quickly, come inside.

00:21:48.830 --> 00:21:49.850
Yes.

00:21:49.850 --> 00:21:51.110
Luka...

00:21:51.110 --> 00:21:52.090
Hey!

00:21:53.050 --> 00:21:54.930
What are you doing? Let's go.

00:21:55.750 --> 00:21:56.630
Yes.

00:23:35.720 --> 00:23:37.580
Yuki-chan, what kind of
sandwiches do you like?

00:23:37.580 --> 00:23:38.820
Why do you ask?

00:23:38.820 --> 00:23:40.990
I like strawberry sandwiches,

00:23:40.990 --> 00:23:44.820
but these days, Tsukumo says he prefers
egg sandwiches over strawberry.

00:23:44.820 --> 00:23:45.930
We've never disagreed on
our favorites before!

00:23:45.930 --> 00:23:47.740
The Vengeful Pair

00:23:47.740 --> 00:23:49.830
You two really are close...

00:23:49.830 --> 00:23:49.900
The Vengeful Pair
